+#' mOTU table from Wirbel et al. meta-analysis of fecal metagenomes.
+#'
+#' A matrix with counts of mOTUs (metagenome-derived OTUs) for each sample. 
+#'
+#' @format A matrix with mOTU counts.
+#' \describe{
+#' \item{otu_table}{OTU table with 566 samples and 845 taxa}
+#' }
+#' 
+#' @references Wirbel, J et al. (2019). \emph{Meta-analysis of fecal metagenomes reveals global microbial signatures that are specific for colorectal cancer}. Nature Medicine, 25, 679–689. <doi: 10.1038/s41591-019-0406-6>.
+"wirbel_otu"
\ No newline at end of file
